   "gap": "The construction or argument and the full treatment promised by proved=annex:p15.countably-generated-radon-nikodym are not supplied in full. The sigma-finite assembly (handbook/annex/p15/density-and-product-exercises.tex lines 178-188) applies the finite/probability construction on each block D_i, and that construction requires its sigma-field to be generated by a sequence of sets. Line 182 asserts 'On D_i, the sets E_j cap D_i generate the restricted sigma-field' with no argument, and no result on the handbook route proves that the trace {A cap D_i : A in sigma(E_1,E_2,...)} equals the sigma-field on D_i generated by the traces E_j cap D_i. The written proof must establish both inclusions of that equality before the block construction uses it.",
